<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: 0 }}>
  <Box style={{ height: 56, background: '#0E3F8C', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', paddingLeft: 40 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>常见坑</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', padding: '0 64px', gap: 14 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#334155' }}>① 漏写 <b>f</b> 前缀 → 花括号被原样输出，变量不替换。</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#334155' }}>② 引号嵌套 → 外层用双引号，内层就用单引号（反之亦然）。</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#334155' }}>③ 中文标点 → 逗号 / 分号要用英文半角，全角会报语法错。</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#334155' }}>④ 变量名拼错 → <code style={{ background:'#EEF2F7', padding:'1px 6px', borderRadius:4 }}>selling_point</code> 别写成 sellingpoint。</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#64748B' }}>出错时先看报错行号，对照上面四条逐一排查。</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', bottom: 0, left: 0, right: 0, height: 34, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'flex-end', paddingRight: 40 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#1E4FA8' }}>08 / 09</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
